stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "候选" as Candidate
    state "生效" as Active
    state "被替代" as Superseded
    state "已抑制，待清理" as Suppressed
    state "已清理" as Deleted
    [*] --> Candidate: 合格来源提取
    Candidate --> Active: 通过策略与来源校验
    Candidate --> Suppressed: 旧版本 / 用户拒绝
    Active --> Superseded: 明确更正，关联新事实
    Active --> Suppressed: 遗忘 / 撤权 / 来源删除
    Superseded --> Suppressed: 遗忘对应范围
    Suppressed --> Deleted: provider 与派生数据清理完成
    Deleted --> [*]
    note right of Active
        只有生效且当前获准的事实
        才能用于检索、注入和简报
    end note
    note right of Deleted
        删除屏障继续生效
        旧任务和旧备份不能恢复内容
    end note
